    - rid: 4707331672703763003
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign above the asylum's reception desk (3D text on the wall, two lines, ALL CAPS, ~16 characters per line). Karlheinz = the asylum's name, keep it
    - rid: 4707331672703763004
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on the records board slot for case file 1 (small label on a wall folder, two lines, ~16 characters per line, ALL CAPS). P3 = Patient 3; the name is not translated
    - rid: 4707331672703763005
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on the records board slot for case file 2 (small label, two lines, ~16 characters per line, ALL CAPS). P11 = Patient 11
    - rid: 4707331672703763006
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on the records board slot for case file 3 (small label, two lines, ~16 characters per line, ALL CAPS). P5 = Patient 5
    - rid: 4707331672703763007
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on the records board slot for case file 4 (small label, one line, ~16 characters, ALL CAPS)
    - rid: 4707331672703763008
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on the records board slot for case file 5 (small label, two lines, ~16 characters per line, ALL CAPS)
    - rid: 4707331672703763009
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on the patient card beside Elias's wristband on the morgue table (two lines, ALL CAPS, ~14 characters per line). Names are not translated
    - rid: 4707331672703763010
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign stencilled on a door to the lower levels (two lines, ALL CAPS, ~14 characters per line). Subject A is a character name
    - rid: 4707331672703763011
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign stencilled on a service robot's bay (one line, ALL CAPS, ~14 characters). Service units are the old maintenance robots
    - rid: 4707331672703763012
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign above the door of the holding room in the Intake tutorial ward (one line, ALL CAPS, ~10 characters)
    - rid: 4707331672703763013
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on a door in the Intake ward that cannot be opened (one line, ALL CAPS, ~10 characters)
    - rid: 4707331672703763014
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign in the Intake ward naming the ward (one line, ALL CAPS, ~20 characters). Keep the middle dot and the number
    - rid: 4707331672703763015
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Warning stencil on the wall of the Intake corridor (two lines, ALL CAPS, ~20 characters per line). "IT" = the hunter, never named
    - rid: 4707331672703763016
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign at the foot of the Intake bed, visible only in the focused torch beam (one line, ALL CAPS, ~16 characters)
    - rid: 4707331672703763017
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign above the contract board in the shop (one line, ALL CAPS, ~10 characters)
    - rid: 4707331672703763018
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: World sign on the shop counter (one line, ALL CAPS, ~18 characters). Shards = the currency (see shop.currency)
    - rid: 4707331692992135921
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Name board hanging over the shop counter (3D text on a wooden board, one line, ALL CAPS, ~12 characters). The shop is an old-fashioned apothecary run by the salesman
    - rid: 4707331692992135922
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Name plate over the exit of the Intake's first room, enamel plate (3D text, one line, ALL CAPS, ~12 characters). The room where the patient is admitted
    - rid: 4707331692992135923
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Name plate over the entrance of the Intake's last room, enamel plate (3D text, one line, ALL CAPS, ~12 characters). The room where patients are watched
    - rid: 4707331692992135924
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Faint older paint behind the ''stay in your bed'' wall warning in the Intake: what the wall used to say before it was painted over (3D text at ~16 % opacity, one line, ALL CAPS, ~12 characters)'
    - rid: 4707331692992135925
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Faint older lettering behind the DAY ROOM name plate in the asylum: what the plate used to say (3D text at ~16 % opacity, one line, ALL CAPS, ~8 characters)'
    - rid: 4707331692992135926
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Name plate over the day room door in the asylum (3D text on an enamel plate, one line, ALL CAPS, ~18 characters). Same words as hub.wing.1.room
    - rid: 4707331692992135927
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Name plate over the machine room door in the asylum (one line, ALL CAPS, ~18 characters). Same words as hub.wing.2.room
    - rid: 4707331692992135928
